  "descriptions": {
    "KillCrypticSaloon": "Cryptics",
    "KillCrypticShielders": "Cryptics",
    "KillCryptics": "Cryptics",
    "challengeWin": "Win a game on Easy Difficulty",
    "challengeWinEasy": "Win a game on Nightmare Difficulty",
    "emoteDeadWeight": "Sometimes you carry the team. \r\nToday, you’re mopping the floor with your face.",
    "emotePrisiadki": "A tasteful tactical squat.\r\nWidely recognized as the intellectual successor to teabagging.",
    "itemBoomerangLvl": "Flies out, bullies enemies for a while, then swings back for another round. \r\nNo ammo needed, perfect for an eco-friendly loadout.",
    "itemBowLvl": "Fires bargain-bin arrows when you quick draw. \r\nBend it like you mean it to drop an explosive banger.",
    "itemDualRevolverLvl": "High fire rate, bad accuracy, yet one reload sends both revolvers soaring into explosive usefulness. A miraculous jump from meh to mayhem.",
    "itemMinigunLvl": "Once it spins up, this thing spews bullets nonstop. Technically stoppable, but you’re a full-time bullet-slinger, not some quitter.",
    "itemPistolLvl": "Reliable at all times, average at everything. \r\nPeak choice for people who fear commitment.",
    "itemSheriffStarLvl": "Launches at high speed and slice enemies. \r\nJustice has never been this low-effort.",
    "itemShotgunLvl": "Weirdly high fire rate for a shotgun, single-shell reloads, and a spread wildfires wish for. At last, a weapon that matches your aim.",
    "itemWinchesterLvl": "Crisp lever action, flawless precision, and rugged reloads. \r\nOnce used to win sickly goldfish at the fair, now wins gunfights.",
    "jokerBellShot": "+5% chance for weakspot hits to summon a healing ghost bell",
    "jokerCactusDay": "+3% chance for a Cactus Mino to spawn when an enemy dies",
    "jokerChonkyThrow": "The boomerang is twice as big",
    "jokerEagleLever": "Consecutive shots without missing grant +5% damage, stacking up to +50%",
    "jokerEcoTrick": "Reloading no longer wastes ammo",
    "jokerElementalSpin": "The minigun has a 30% chance to fire a random elemental bullet instead of a regular one",
    "jokerFanningAce": "Fire mid-reload at the right moment to chain-fire all bullets with low accuracy",
    "jokerFistFight": "Your melee hits are twice as powerful",
    "jokerFocusShot": "Every kill reduces the cooldown of your spells by 1 second",
    "jokerFrenzySpin": "While your kill counter is above 10, the minigun fires twice as fast",
    "jokerGoldProspector": "Increase your acquired Gold by 20% at the end of a mission",
    "jokerHoarder": "+15% chance that collecting a Joker makes another random one appear",
    "jokerHomingBurst": "Every 20 bullets fired, shoot 5 homing bullets at nearby enemies",
    "jokerJumpStar": "+2 Jump while holding the Sheriff Stars",
    "jokerLingeringThrow": "Doubles the lingering time. Combines with Lingering Time upgrade",
    "jokerMarkAce": "Bullets mark enemies for 3s. Marked enemies take +15% damage",
    "jokerMindShot": "Your weakspot hits cause an explosion",
    "jokerOverBlast": "Shoot an extra pellet for every round missing from the magazine",
    "jokerPickPick": "+5% chance on hit to spawn damaging pickaxes on the target",
    "jokerRushBlast": "The first bullet in your magazine has 100% accuracy and shoots further away",
    "jokerScavengerStar": "Gain +30% move speed and +100% pickup range",
    "jokerShroomGrave": "+10% chance for a shroom to spawn when an enemy dies",
    "jokerSoulReaper": "Increase your acquired Souls by 20% at the end of a mission",
    "jokerStackedLever": "Instantly reload 2 bullets from your reserve ammo on kill",
    "jokerSwampTrick": "Reload explosions now leave puddles on the ground",
    "killCryptic": "Cryptics",
    "skinBlink": "He dreams of velvet curtains and standing ovations, but only found gunpowder and emergency extractions.",
    "skinCariboo": "Snowman-crazed, he genuinely sees every enemy as a naughty snowman that needs discipline.",
    "skinDrSparkTwist": "Dr Spark-Twist Skin",
    "skinFortuna": "Fortuna Bluff",
    "skinGravekeeper": "Paid by the grave, so he’s weirdly rooting for the invaders. \r\nNot exactly the villagers’ favorite.",
    "skinMarauder": "He came for the Gold. He stayed because he got lost. \r\nHe fights because he’s mad about it.",
    "skinOtto": "He loves bureaucracy and dreams of taxing bounty rewards.\r\nRefuse to comply and he will promptly slap you in the face.",
    "skinPumpkinJack": "Already the god of his own game, so he figured he might as well stroll in and wreck the Far Far West too.",
    "skinSheriff": "He doesn’t move much. Or talk. Or blink. Honestly, we’re not even sure he’s alive, but damn, he looks cool.",
    "skinWanderingTrader": "She has killed more invaders than you ever will, yet she somehow stays humble.",
    "skinWillyBilly": "Need something fixed? He’s already halfway done. \r\nNeed a friend? He’s been here the whole time."
  },
